WEBVTT

00:13:59.167 --> 00:14:00.377
But here’s the thing.

00:14:00.377 --> 00:14:02.629
I ain’t cheap,
and I’m definitely not free,

00:14:02.629 --> 00:14:04.464
so don't get any ideas.

00:14:04.464 --> 00:14:05.465
(Laughter)

00:14:05.465 --> 00:14:06.466
(Applause)

00:14:07.759 --> 00:14:11.638
But I am here in this
“Mama I made it” moment

00:14:11.638 --> 00:14:15.225
as someone who can show up
as her most Bevyest self

00:14:15.225 --> 00:14:16.602
because I’ve done the work.

00:14:17.519 --> 00:14:19.354
Yeah, my most Bevyest self.

00:14:19.771 --> 00:14:22.149
So, you know, I’m going to show up --

00:14:22.149 --> 00:14:24.151
some of you’ve met me --

00:14:24.151 --> 00:14:26.695
you know I’m vibrant
and boisterous, AKA loud.

00:14:27.279 --> 00:14:30.407
OK, you know that I’m going to show up,